by nicolas-grekas at 2026-11-15T11:23:37Z

I pushed two optimizations. Chunks without chars above U+07FF now use a pattern with smaller, inlined classes. Iterating 80 KB of Russian goes from 20 to 5 ms, and French from 11 to 8 ms. The ZWJ + emoji rule is applied after matching instead of in the pattern, which also makes long ZWJ sequences pass with the JIT disabled. Behavior is unchanged on the conformance file and against intl.
